[7201]={"#Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.","Get 10 Essence of the Elements - from Scald, Warbringer Construct, Ragereaver Golem - Searing Gorge (51, 47)"},
[7383]={"#Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.","Get Filled Amethyst Phial"},
[7441]={"#Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary. Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.","Get Book of Incantations - from Pusillin - Dire Maul"},
[7461]={"#You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated. Enter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum. Return to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.","Kill 1 Immol'thar - Dire Maul","Kill 1 Prince Tortheldrin - Dire Maul"},
[7462]={"#Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!"},
