[7627]={"#Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.","Get 6 Large Brilliant Shard","Get 25 Dark Iron Ore - from Dark Iron Deposit, Warbringer Construct, Wrath Hammer Construct"},
